  "label": "Swing Bat Action",
  "description": "The phrase 'can't swing it' is a common idiom referring to the inability to perform a physical action, particularly swinging a bat in baseball. This idiom is culturally understood to imply incompetence or failure in a task. The bottom image of a man holding a bat reinforces this metaphor, even though the bat is not being swung. The meme relies on the viewer's knowledge of this idiom to understand the humor or mockery.",
